":{"en":"Upper secondary year 2","local":{"fo":"2. ár"}},"aliases":[],"voiceOnly":false},{"id":"midnam-3","stage":"midnam","year":12,"age":18,"name":{"en":"Upper secondary year 3","local":{"fo":"3. ár"}},"aliases":[],"voiceOnly":false}],"until":null,"notes":"Undirvísingarskylda starts on 1 August of the calendar year a child turns 7 and lasts nine years; the optional forskúli year is not counted. The fólkaskúli is a nine-year grundskúli (1.–9. flokkur) plus an optional one-year 10. flokkur, which is left out, as Denmark's 10. klasse is. The three-year gymnasial lines (búskapar-, hug-, náttúru-, tøknibreyt) admit pupils who completed 9. flokk; the two-year fyrireikingarbreyt needs age 18. Upper-secondary years follow the law's 1.–3. ár; everyday names such as 1.g are not confirmed."}]
